sequenceDiagram
  actor B as Bob
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant SE as settlement-service
  participant WA as wallet-service
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant EX as expense-service
  participant NO as notification-service
  B->>GW: POST /api/debts/{id}/pay
  GW->>SE: route
  SE->>WA: POST /api/wallets/transfers (Idempotency-Key = debtId)
  alt solde suffisant
    WA-->>SE: 200 {transactionId}
    SE->>SE: dette → PAID + Payment SUCCESS
    SE-->>B: 200 OK
    SE--)MQ: publie debt.settled
    MQ--)EX: part de Bob → PAID
    MQ--)NO: "Bob t'a payé"
  else solde insuffisant
    WA-->>SE: 409 INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS (rien n'est débité)
    SE->>SE: dette reste UNPAID + Payment FAILED
    SE-->>B: 409
    SE--)MQ: publie settlement.failed
    MQ--)NO: "Paiement refusé : solde insuffisant"
  else wallet-service indisponible
    SE-->>B: 503 (circuit breaker) – dette inchangée, nouvel essai sûr grâce à l'idempotence
  end
